# examples/games/03_space_invaders, played: shot down, then every alien.
#
# The ship is on the arrows, at 360 px/s, and fires on Space (ui_accept), one
# shot a press. Each alien's gun is a Timer whose period rmp::random drew when
# the alien was made, from seed 1 -- so the second game's aliens, made after
# the first game's drew theirs, fire on a schedule of their own, and every
# run of this script is the same run. See tests/e2e/script.h for the grammar.

# --- the failure path: three hits -----------------------------------------------

# The ship goes and stands under the aliens' shots: the first lands in frame
# 333, the second in 454 -- the ship is safe for 1.2 s after each -- and the
# third ends the game.
298 press KEY_LEFT
314 release KEY_LEFT
334 press KEY_RIGHT
340 release KEY_RIGHT
368 press KEY_RIGHT
399 release KEY_RIGHT
425 press KEY_LEFT
452 release KEY_LEFT
490 press KEY_LEFT
512 release KEY_LEFT
520 press KEY_LEFT
526 release KEY_LEFT
532 expect scene InvadersScene
533 expect scene OverScene
536 shot game_over

# Play again, with the mouse: down on 545, up on 546, the new game from 547.
545 click 400 245
545 expect scene OverScene
546 expect scene InvadersScene

# --- the happy path: forty-four aliens -----------------------------------------

# A player's pace: a shot at most every eighth frame, 7.5 a second, each one
# where an alien will be when it gets there, and out of the way of what comes
# down. Recorded, not written by hand: a bot that knows the formation's rule
# chose each press -- 44 shots, not one wasted. With the block allowed to
# speed up without limit (the game as it was), the last alien came down at
# over 300 px/s, and at this pace the bot shot every alien but that one.
547 tap KEY_SPACE
547 press KEY_RIGHT
555 tap KEY_SPACE
563 tap KEY_SPACE
566 release KEY_RIGHT
569 tap KEY_RIGHT
571 tap KEY_SPACE
572 press KEY_RIGHT
579 tap KEY_SPACE
587 tap KEY_SPACE
587 release KEY_RIGHT
588 press KEY_RIGHT
595 tap KEY_SPACE
595 release KEY_RIGHT
596 press KEY_LEFT
603 tap KEY_SPACE
611 tap KEY_SPACE
619 tap KEY_SPACE
627 tap KEY_SPACE
635 tap KEY_SPACE
643 tap KEY_SPACE
647 release KEY_LEFT
649 tap KEY_LEFT
651 tap KEY_SPACE
652 press KEY_LEFT
659 tap KEY_SPACE
667 tap KEY_SPACE
675 tap KEY_SPACE
683 tap KEY_SPACE
684 tap KEY_RIGHT
684 release KEY_LEFT
688 tap KEY_RIGHT
691 tap KEY_SPACE
692 press KEY_RIGHT
699 tap KEY_SPACE

