705 shot bottom_row_gone
707 tap KEY_SPACE
715 tap KEY_SPACE
723 tap KEY_SPACE
729 release KEY_RIGHT
731 tap KEY_SPACE
731 press KEY_RIGHT
739 tap KEY_SPACE
746 release KEY_RIGHT
747 tap KEY_SPACE
748 press KEY_RIGHT
756 tap KEY_SPACE
764 tap KEY_SPACE
771 release KEY_RIGHT
772 tap KEY_SPACE
772 press KEY_LEFT
