780 tap KEY_SPACE
781 press KEY_LEFT
788 tap KEY_SPACE
796 tap KEY_SPACE
806 tap KEY_SPACE
814 tap KEY_SPACE
820 release KEY_LEFT
822 tap KEY_SPACE
822 press KEY_LEFT
